WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.170
Sampling a bell curve, nearly free.

2
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:07.047
Sampling a smooth bell-shaped cloud usually costs a power of the dimension.

3
00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:13.157
Blur the target, solve near-bell pieces by nesting averages, then unblur.

4
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.261
Claimed: d to any epsilon queries suffice.

5
00:00:17.300 --> 00:00:18.514
Lean checks the theorem.
